Subject: [PATCH] android: play a silent audio loop while web-source caches
 download

Rebased for Animeko v6.3.0 while retaining the existing Harmony behavior.
Keep the upstream PikPak lifecycle and add the same Harmony silent-audio, wake-lock and battery-exemption support used for HTTP downloads.
